WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.033 --> 00:00:01.334
A new flashpoint in

00:00:01.334 --> 00:00:03.103
Russia's war against Ukraine.

00:00:03.103 --> 00:00:04.471
Moscow accusing

00:00:04.471 --> 00:00:06.339
Ukraine of trying to assassinate

00:00:06.339 --> 00:00:07.841
President Vladimir Putin

00:00:07.841 --> 00:00:10.043
with drone strikes on the Kremlin

00:00:10.043 --> 00:00:10.844
the Kiev government

00:00:10.844 --> 00:00:12.112
denying any involvement

00:00:12.112 --> 00:00:13.013
and suggesting

00:00:13.013 --> 00:00:14.447
suggesting Russians

00:00:14.447 --> 00:00:16.483
may actually be to blame for that.

00:00:16.483 --> 00:00:17.617
Here's CNN senior

00:00:17.617 --> 00:00:19.119
international correspondent

00:00:19.119 --> 00:00:20.987
Matthew Chance.

00:00:21.521 --> 00:00:22.622
Is this the moment

00:00:22.622 --> 00:00:24.758
Russia's war in Ukraine

00:00:24.758 --> 00:00:26.793
finally struck home

00:00:26.793 --> 00:00:28.661
to drone attacks on the Kremlin?

00:00:28.661 --> 00:00:30.030
Minutes apart,

00:00:30.030 --> 00:00:31.097
leaving smoke

00:00:31.097 --> 00:00:33.533
billowing from the historic buildings

00:00:33.533 --> 00:00:35.168
and an extraordinary scene

00:00:35.168 --> 00:00:36.436
of vulnerability

00:00:36.436 --> 00:00:38.505
at the heart of the Russian state.

00:00:38.972 --> 00:00:40.040
Russia's gastronomy.

00:00:40.040 --> 00:00:43.109
It was hours before Kremlin controlled TV

00:00:43.109 --> 00:00:44.644
announced the news

00:00:44.644 --> 00:00:46.980
in the form of an official statement

00:00:46.980 --> 00:00:49.115
blaming Ukraine

00:00:49.249 --> 00:00:51.051
Last night's the Kiev regime

00:00:51.051 --> 00:00:52.886
attempted a drone strike

00:00:52.886 --> 00:00:54.988
against the residence of the president

00:00:54.988 --> 00:00:56.589
of the Russian Federation.

00:00:56.589 --> 00:00:59.492
The statement reads We view these actions

00:00:59.626 --> 00:01:01.694
as a planned terrorist attack

00:01:02.028 --> 00:01:04.097
and an assassination attempt.

00:01:04.664 --> 00:01:06.766
Adding that Russia reserves the right

00:01:06.766 --> 00:01:08.835
to take countermeasures wherever

00:01:09.002 --> 00:01:11.604
and whenever it deems appropriate.

00:01:12.572 --> 00:01:13.840
Amid calls in Russia

00:01:13.840 --> 00:01:14.941
for an overwhelming

00:01:14.941 --> 00:01:16.242
military response,

00:01:16.242 --> 00:01:18.511
Ukraine's president visiting Finland

00:01:18.812 --> 00:01:20.814
is distancing his country

00:01:20.814 --> 00:01:22.282
from the incident.

00:01:22.282 --> 00:01:25.051
We don't attack

00:01:25.051 --> 00:01:28.588
Putin or Moscow

00:01:28.588 --> 00:01:31.458
We fight on on our territory.

00:01:31.458 --> 00:01:33.626
And we are defending our villages

00:01:33.626 --> 00:01:34.861
and cities.

00:01:34.861 --> 00:01:36.296
We don't have,

00:01:36.296 --> 00:01:38.565
you know, enough weapons for these.

00:01:39.065 --> 00:01:41.401
It's more likely a false flag operation

00:01:41.601 --> 00:01:43.803
or local resistance forces in Russia,

00:01:43.970 --> 00:01:45.538
say Ukrainian officials

00:01:45.538 --> 00:01:48.074
that are responsible for this

00:01:48.074 --> 00:01:49.109
In recent weeks,

00:01:49.109 --> 00:01:51.344
even days have seen an upsurge

00:01:51.344 --> 00:01:53.046
in unexplained attacks

00:01:53.046 --> 00:01:56.049
inside Russian territory

00:01:56.049 --> 00:01:57.584
like this train derailment

00:01:57.584 --> 00:01:58.351
in the Bryant Park

00:01:58.351 --> 00:02:01.554
region near the Ukrainian border,

00:02:01.554 --> 00:02:03.857
or this key oil storage facility

00:02:03.857 --> 00:02:05.225
in southern Russia

00:02:05.225 --> 00:02:06.559
annexed Crimea,

00:02:06.559 --> 00:02:09.496
set ablaze, also using a drone causing

00:02:09.496 --> 00:02:11.965
significant disruption

00:02:13.099 --> 00:02:15.001
One former Russian lawmaker

00:02:15.001 --> 00:02:16.169
now in exile

00:02:16.169 --> 00:02:17.403
and linked with groups

00:02:17.403 --> 00:02:18.605
carrying out operations

00:02:18.605 --> 00:02:19.606
in Russia

00:02:19.606 --> 00:02:22.675
tells CNN the Kremlin attack is the work

00:02:22.909 --> 00:02:25.445
of what he calls Russian Partizans.

00:02:25.712 --> 00:02:27.614
Some of them are focused on

00:02:27.614 --> 00:02:28.815
railroad sabotage

00:02:28.815 --> 00:02:30.750
or some of them doing arsons

00:02:30.750 --> 00:02:31.918
or military recruitment.

00:02:31.918 --> 00:02:35.054
Posts, some of them doing attacks on

00:02:35.889 --> 00:02:37.023
activists, pro-war

00:02:37.023 --> 00:02:38.625
activists, some of them doing

00:02:38.625 --> 00:02:39.692
hacking attacks.

00:02:39.692 --> 00:02:41.628
Are any of these partizans

00:02:41.628 --> 00:02:43.530
supported by

00:02:43.530 --> 00:02:45.165
the Ukrainian special services,

00:02:45.165 --> 00:02:45.765
for instance,

00:02:45.765 --> 00:02:46.799
because Ukraine says

00:02:46.799 --> 00:02:49.302
it's got nothing to do with this attack.

00:02:49.302 --> 00:02:51.171
Do you believe that claim?

00:02:51.171 --> 00:02:51.871
Well, look,

00:02:51.871 --> 00:02:53.873
Ukrainians, it has nothing to do with us

00:02:55.208 --> 00:02:55.808
because it's

00:02:55.808 --> 00:02:58.178
all organized by the Russians.

00:02:58.178 --> 00:03:00.280
But whoever's responsible is a threat

00:03:00.914 --> 00:03:01.614
at the moment.

00:03:01.614 --> 00:03:03.683
Preparations are continuing

00:03:03.683 --> 00:03:04.417
for the annual

00:03:04.417 --> 00:03:05.919
May the Ninth Victory Day

00:03:05.919 --> 00:03:06.819
Parade in Red

00:03:06.819 --> 00:03:09.155
Square near where the drones struck.

00:03:09.822 --> 00:03:10.890
But the weakness

00:03:10.890 --> 00:03:12.992
and the insecurity of the Kremlin

00:03:12.992 --> 00:03:15.662
has now been exposed for all to see.

00:03:17.330 --> 00:03:18.765
But, Wolf, as well as publicly

00:03:18.765 --> 00:03:20.400
denying any involvement

00:03:20.400 --> 00:03:21.301
with this drone

00:03:21.301 --> 00:03:22.702
incident, Ukrainian officials

00:03:22.702 --> 00:03:23.836
tell us tonight

00:03:23.836 --> 00:03:24.771
that they're also

00:03:24.771 --> 00:03:27.607
privately reiterating that two officials

00:03:27.607 --> 00:03:28.641
in the United States

00:03:28.641 --> 00:03:30.310
and other allies as well.

00:03:30.310 --> 00:03:32.111
Meanwhile, in Russia,

00:03:32.111 --> 00:03:34.080
there are calls for vengeance

00:03:34.080 --> 00:03:34.914
in the media

00:03:34.914 --> 00:03:37.183
and among senior Russian officials

00:03:37.183 --> 00:03:38.418
after what many they view

00:03:38.418 --> 00:03:40.220
as a humiliating strike

00:03:40.220 --> 00:03:42.555
in the heart of the Russian capital Wolf.

00:03:43.022 --> 00:03:44.424
Matthew Chance reporting for us.

00:03:44.424 --> 00:03:45.391
Thank you, Matthew.

00:03:45.391 --> 00:03:46.526
Let's bring in our experts,

00:03:46.526 --> 00:03:47.594
our national security,

00:03:47.594 --> 00:03:49.629
the military and Russia

00:03:49.629 --> 00:03:51.965
and General Retired General Spider Marks.

00:03:51.965 --> 00:03:53.733
Let's talk about the possibilities

00:03:53.733 --> 00:03:55.101
of who is behind this.

00:03:55.101 --> 00:03:56.169
What's your analysis

00:03:58.771 --> 00:03:59.205
Well, first

00:03:59.205 --> 00:04:00.273
of all, we have to all agree

00:04:00.273 --> 00:04:01.741
that something like this occurred,

00:04:01.741 --> 00:04:04.077
that this wasn't staged.

00:04:04.077 --> 00:04:04.510
I would

00:04:04.510 --> 00:04:05.511
I would suggest that it's

00:04:05.511 --> 00:04:08.047
probably some independent organization

00:04:08.114 --> 00:04:08.915
as described

00:04:08.915 --> 00:04:09.949
in the previous report,

00:04:09.949 --> 00:04:11.351
could be partizans.

00:04:11.351 --> 00:04:11.818
Clearly,

00:04:11.818 --> 00:04:14.187
there is an element within Russia

00:04:14.487 --> 00:04:15.722
that does not agree

00:04:15.722 --> 00:04:17.290
with what Putin is trying to achieve

00:04:17.290 --> 00:04:18.858
and has been a part of this journey

00:04:18.858 --> 00:04:20.460
over the course of the last 18 months

00:04:20.460 --> 00:04:22.829
where it's going sideways multiple times.

00:04:22.829 --> 00:04:23.763
So you could see that

00:04:23.763 --> 00:04:26.132
the element of control is starting to be,

00:04:26.132 --> 00:04:26.566
you know,

00:04:26.566 --> 00:04:28.301
those controls are starting

00:04:28.301 --> 00:04:29.302
to be released

00:04:29.302 --> 00:04:31.738
somewhat by internal organizations.

00:04:31.938 --> 00:04:33.072
And this may be exactly

00:04:33.072 --> 00:04:33.873
what we're seeing.

00:04:33.873 --> 00:04:34.941
I tend to believe that

00:04:34.941 --> 00:04:36.442
it was not the Ukrainians

00:04:36.442 --> 00:04:37.143
because they wouldn't

00:04:37.143 --> 00:04:38.011
have been able

00:04:38.011 --> 00:04:40.947
to transit the excess of 300 miles

00:04:41.180 --> 00:04:42.982
from the border of Ukraine

00:04:42.982 --> 00:04:44.784
and hover over the Kremlin

00:04:44.784 --> 00:04:45.718
that would speak

00:04:45.718 --> 00:04:47.687
horribly toward the Russian air defense

00:04:47.687 --> 00:04:49.489
I don't know that it's that bad.

00:04:49.489 --> 00:04:51.491
Yeah. Good point. A best center.

00:04:51.624 --> 00:04:52.125
What do you see

00:04:52.125 --> 00:04:53.860
as a possible explanation

00:04:53.860 --> 00:04:55.094
and how do you assess

00:04:55.094 --> 00:04:56.095
the Russian claim

00:04:56.095 --> 00:04:57.263
that this was actually

00:04:57.263 --> 00:04:59.299
a Ukrainian assassination

00:04:59.299 --> 00:05:00.600
attempt against Putin?

00:05:02.468 --> 00:05:03.069
Well, I agree with

00:05:03.069 --> 00:05:06.005
Spider that it probably

00:05:06.406 --> 00:05:06.773
you know,

00:05:06.773 --> 00:05:07.540
there are a lot of reasons

00:05:07.540 --> 00:05:08.775
why it wouldn't be Russia

00:05:08.775 --> 00:05:10.576
just because it exposes

00:05:10.576 --> 00:05:11.811
so many weaknesses.

00:05:11.811 --> 00:05:12.478
On the other hand,

00:05:12.478 --> 00:05:13.413
you can see

00:05:13.413 --> 00:05:14.881
how Russia might see this

00:05:14.881 --> 00:05:16.416
as a necessary part of

00:05:16.416 --> 00:05:19.052
of rallying people around the flag.

00:05:19.819 --> 00:05:20.053
You know,

00:05:20.053 --> 00:05:20.787
that said, I'm

00:05:20.787 --> 00:05:21.587
not sure I agree

00:05:21.587 --> 00:05:22.722
that the Ukrainians don't

00:05:22.722 --> 00:05:24.123
have the ability to do this.

00:05:24.123 --> 00:05:25.892
They have long range drones.

00:05:25.892 --> 00:05:26.993
There have been drones

00:05:26.993 --> 00:05:29.896
within, you know, tens of miles of

00:05:30.463 --> 00:05:31.964
of the Kremlin.

00:05:31.964 --> 00:05:33.299
I would say, though,

00:05:33.299 --> 00:05:35.401
on the whole idea of the assassination,

00:05:35.401 --> 00:05:37.270
that's really poppycock.

00:05:37.270 --> 00:05:41.374
I can't imagine that that is at all

00:05:41.374 --> 00:05:42.575
in the realm of possibility.

00:05:42.575 --> 00:05:44.243
It's not like a drone carries

00:05:44.243 --> 00:05:45.878
a bunker buster.

00:05:45.878 --> 00:05:47.447
So that's kind of silly.

00:05:47.447 --> 00:05:49.215
And and if anything, it is

00:05:49.215 --> 00:05:50.817
just a way of Moscow

00:05:50.817 --> 00:05:53.152
spinning this story to make it look less

00:05:53.152 --> 00:05:55.088
bad and less less embarrassing

00:05:55.088 --> 00:05:55.722
and give them

00:05:55.722 --> 00:05:56.789
give them an excuse

00:05:56.789 --> 00:05:59.158
to conduct more attacks.

00:05:59.826 --> 00:06:00.727
Jill Dougherty,

00:06:00.727 --> 00:06:01.794
you're an expert on Russia.

00:06:01.794 --> 00:06:03.463
How do you think this might play into

00:06:03.463 --> 00:06:05.832
Putin's mindset? What happened today

00:06:07.533 --> 00:06:09.902
Well, I think he will be infuriated, No.

00:06:09.902 --> 00:06:10.403
One.

00:06:10.403 --> 00:06:12.171
Because I do agree it's

00:06:12.171 --> 00:06:13.773
highly embarrassing.

00:06:13.773 --> 00:06:14.107
I mean,

00:06:14.107 --> 00:06:15.742
even if you thought

00:06:15.742 --> 00:06:18.544
that it was a false flag giving Russia

00:06:18.544 --> 00:06:21.414
a cover to attack Ukraine,

00:06:21.581 --> 00:06:23.983
they don't really need that anymore.

00:06:24.951 --> 00:06:26.319
So I think,

00:06:26.319 --> 00:06:28.054
you know, for the Russian public,

00:06:28.054 --> 00:06:31.324
this is very worrying and embarrassing

00:06:31.324 --> 00:06:33.426
that even right in the heart of Moscow,

00:06:33.726 --> 00:06:34.961
they're not protected.

00:06:34.961 --> 00:06:37.964
Even in a way Putin wasn't,

00:06:37.964 --> 00:06:40.099
because the Kremlin is the most

00:06:40.099 --> 00:06:43.269
highly protected official place

00:06:43.436 --> 00:06:45.004
probably in the world.

00:06:45.004 --> 00:06:47.573
So and the other thing I think that's

00:06:48.241 --> 00:06:49.842
very worrying about this

00:06:49.842 --> 00:06:52.111
is there is a possibility

00:06:52.111 --> 00:06:53.012
that there could be

00:06:53.012 --> 00:06:54.614
these partizan groups.

00:06:54.614 --> 00:06:55.982
And if they are

00:06:55.982 --> 00:06:57.817
and this is still a theory,

00:06:57.817 --> 00:06:59.919
it could be an excuse by the Kremlin

00:06:59.919 --> 00:07:01.888
to have a purge.

00:07:01.888 --> 00:07:03.589
I mean, in Russian history,

00:07:03.589 --> 00:07:04.891
there have been events

00:07:04.891 --> 00:07:07.827
like an assassination of Kirov,

00:07:07.860 --> 00:07:10.196
who was the head of the Leningrad Party

00:07:10.196 --> 00:07:12.064
back in the 1930s.

00:07:12.064 --> 00:07:14.367
Stalin launched the Great Purge.

00:07:14.667 --> 00:07:16.736
So you never know how you know

00:07:17.003 --> 00:07:18.571
that might be an excuse

00:07:18.571 --> 00:07:19.272
for launching

00:07:19.272 --> 00:07:22.442
an internal operation against their

00:07:22.442 --> 00:07:22.942
own people.

00:07:24.210 --> 00:07:24.744
Interesting.

00:07:24.744 --> 00:07:25.111
Indeed.

00:07:25.111 --> 00:07:25.812
All right, guys, thank

00:07:25.812 --> 00:07:26.913
you very, very much.

